GUI CHOICE _DUPLICATE_DELIMS_CSV_1 yes%no Skip Duplicate Delimiters:
GUI CHOICE SORT_GROUP_CSV_1 yes%no Sorting Enabled:
GUI OPTIONAL GUI_LINE_TABLE _SORT_PARAMS_CSV_1 NOT_OK_IF_INVALID%NO_LABEL%ROW_DELIM:;%COL_DELIM:,%HAS_DEFAULTS%START_NUM_ROWS:3%"Attribute"%"STRING_OR_CHOICE_ENCODED ATTRIBUTES col0%col1"%%"Alpha/Num"%"LOOKUP_CHOICE SORT_CHOICE Alphabetic,alphabetic%Numeric,numeric"%alphabetic%"Order"%"LOOKUP_CHOICE SORT_ORDER Ascending,ascending%Descending,descending"%ascending Sorting Parameters:
GUI CHOICE FILTER_GROUP_CSV_1 yes%no Filter Enabled:
